<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="5"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="" size="5">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></div><div style=""><font size="5"><br></font></div><div style=""><p style=""><font size="5"><br>As promised, I want to put you in touch with Joe McBreen, one of our approved lenders that provides financing for our clients in all 5 of our markets.<br><br><font face="arial" style=""><b><font color="#3366ff"><a data-cke-saved-href="http://www.bemortgage.com/joem/?gclid=EAIaIQobChMI3trDiJCo2QIVWLjACh0sjw5FEAAYASAAEgJbc_D_BwE" href="http://www.bemortgage.com/joem/?gclid=EAIaIQobChMI3trDiJCo2QIVWLjACh0sjw5FEAAYASAAEgJbc_D_BwE"></a></font></b></font><font face="arial" style=""><b><font color="#3366ff"><a data-cke-saved-href="http://www.bemortgage.com/joem/?gclid=EAIaIQobChMI3trDiJCo2QIVWLjACh0sjw5FEAAYASAAEgJbc_D_BwE" href="http://www.bemortgage.com/joem/?gclid=EAIaIQobChMI3trDiJCo2QIVWLjACh0sjw5FEAAYASAAEgJbc_D_BwE">Please use the link included in Joe McBreen's contact info</a>&nbsp;</font></b>t</font> <font face="arial" style="">hat will take you to Joe's online application for financing. <br><br>Joe's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and let you know that you are pre-approved, assuming you have provided all the information requested.</font><br><br>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved.<br><br>The next step after pre-approval is for us to define the investment criteria for your first property selection(s) to start off your portfolio with our team.</font><br><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt;"></p><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color:#1f497d;"><span style="font-family:calibri,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;"><img width="600" height="5" id="m_7899550035781880440m_-930273252807433251Picture_x0020_1" data-cke-saved-s